{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2026-02", "window": 1, "start_date": 1769904000, "end_date": 1770508799, "month_true_total": 2042, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:08:54 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "217818916", "author": {"steamid": "76561198755648660", "personaname": "DEV", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198755648660/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 429, "last_played": 1770106008, "avatar": "257d86a30f1d18ed4b4970ab35000ab6ddc2c19b"}, "language": "english", "review": "goated", "timestamp_created": 1770507879, "timestamp_updated": 1770507879, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217817960", "author": {"steamid": "76561198058777137", "personaname": "jexadox", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jexadox/", "num_games_owned": 70, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 35248, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 4412, "playtime_at_review": 15307, "last_played": 1789377287, "avatar": "c36278a285ca8fa44f7c4bece1d6f409d8d12075"}, "language": "english", "review": "There is so much to do. fishing, hunting, fast paced missions, slowly explore and find all the hidden loot, story quests. take your pick this game has so much diverse ways to play. If you don't like one activity, find something else to do. \r\nHas very unique movement style. almost fluid. some warframes can flat out fly. And no punishment for 'falling off the map'\r\nthe only failing it might have is pvp lol. but its not balanced for that kind of play. its balanced for team work with everyone holding dif strengths and play styles. Though most ppl play solo, that is a completly viable way to play too.", "timestamp_created": 1770506893, "timestamp_updated": 1770506893, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217817555", "author": {"steamid": "76561198110566844", "personaname": "AtamaYoMama", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198110566844/", "num_games_owned": 34, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 43490, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 174, "playtime_at_review": 4240, "last_played": 1788842166, "avatar": "5a1a9c994a33ae7cedc845681e02a7beb8767d23"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've lost count of how many years I've played Warframe, first on the XBOX and now on PC, but they've been years well spent. A little difficult to get into with the sheer volume of lore and content, its best the start at your own pace. (Don't let your buddy that really wants to you play with them taxi you around, you will almost certainly get overwhelmed, I know I did when my brothers first dragged *me* through the Origin System) A Free to Play that is ACTUALLY Free to Play, very little content is truly locked behind a paywall. Platinum *can* be bought with irl money, but if you put in the work you can earn the Plat through smart trading. (I spend a little every now and then just to support the game.) Great community, fantastic developers, one of my all time favorite games.", "timestamp_created": 1770506470, "timestamp_updated": 1770506470, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217817022", "author": {"steamid": "76561198326867220", "personaname": "Jay", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Drxmx/", "num_games_owned": 186, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9876, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 47, "playtime_at_review": 6355, "last_played": 1789267018, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "banger game", "timestamp_created": 1770505864, "timestamp_updated": 1770505864, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217816867", "author": {"steamid": "76561199673813690", "personaname": "Galaxy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199673813690/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 29742, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 104, "playtime_at_review": 4801, "last_played": 1789357094, "avatar": "0a4d47062a00f24cdfe0aa194e3b407120d3c7cb"}, "language": "english", "review": "sigma", "timestamp_created": 1770505714, "timestamp_updated": 1770505714, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}